Design and platform knowledge
-----------------------------

The plugin builds on the public plugin contracts of DeepSeek Harness
(slot contracts, `compactRegion`, `dsh.bundle.patch`, `dsh.client`). Where a
behaviour of the host is relied upon, it is documented in
`COMPATIBILITY-AUDIT.md` with the version tag and commit that were inspected.
